{{feat
|epic=yes
|type=combat
|prereq=21st level; [[weapon focus]], [[epic weapon focus]], and [[weapon specialization]] all in the chosen weapon
|desc=The character gains a +4 bonus to all damage done by the chosen weapon.
|use=automatic
|bonus1=champion of Torm
|bonus2=fighter
}}

==Notes==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This feat [[stack]]s with [[weapon specialization]], for a total of +6 bonus to damage.
* This feat can only be taken on a [[fighter]] or [[champion of Torm]] level.
* The weapon specialization prerequisite implies that (at least) four fighter levels are required to take this feat. If the fourth fighter level is taken at an epic general feat level (24, 27, etc.) after epic weapon focus is taken, both weapon specialization and epic weapon specialization can be taken at the same time (one would be the general feat, the other the fighter bonus feat &mdash; the usual behavior for feats and prerequisites).

==Custom content notes==
*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.
[[category:feats restricted by class, epic]]